5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure this selection is based on evidence. I want to see what previous trials actually achieved for our patients.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Merit is one thing, but capacity is another. We need to know if our physical infrastructure can handle more traffic.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. We should also examine why previous joint ventures failed. Logic suggests we avoid repeating structural mistakes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about the people doing the work! We have to check the current staffing levels before adding more tasks.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that a seed cannot grow without soil. We must verify the actual budget and how it sustains itself.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, which specific infrastructure concerns you most? The booking system or the physical rooms?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Both. The booking system's records and the parking situation are critical bottlenecks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, are you looking at general vacancies or specific departmental reviews?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I think both ward vacancies and the therapy/midwifery reviews would be helpful to see the full picture.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to see such diligence. I shall look into the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the readmission figures from the call-back trial and the shared nursing round completion.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I'll stick with the booking system records and the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll investigate the board minutes on the joint clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll take the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,A sound plan. Let us gather the facts before we commit our resources.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
