59,3,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"We have Home Follow-Up, Perinatal Support, Day Rehab, and Chronic Care. Home Follow-Up has the best evidence for readmissions.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"But Home Follow-Up and Day Rehab fail the infrastructure test. One is invisible, the other is too bulky.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Chronic Care Coordination relies on outside surgeries. Given the fourteen-month delay for data agreements, it's a non-starter.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Perinatal Support uses the midwifery slack. It doesn't add pressure to the struggling ward nurses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Perinatal Support is on-site, meaning it generates revenue. It is the only one that fits the budget and the space.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"I dislike ignoring the readmission data, but the visit completion rates for home rounds were dismal.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I cannot vote for anything that requires more parking or more shuttle runs. Perinatal is the most compact.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I'll support Perinatal. It's a contained internal arrangement, avoiding the external dependencies that usually break our programs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm fully in favor of Perinatal Support. It supports new parents without breaking our staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is the path of balance. It respects the ledger and the people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"If the others are truly unfeasible, I will concede. Perinatal Support is the most viable option.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It is the only one that doesn't risk a systemic seizure.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The logic is sound.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm so glad we found something that works for everyone!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,A harmonious conclusion. Let us cast our votes.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
